WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.481
Aaker's model says brand equity comes from five assets:

00:00:03.531 --> 00:00:04.331
awareness,

00:00:04.285 --> 00:00:05.261
perceived quality,

00:00:05.311 --> 00:00:06.323
associations,

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:07.173
loyalty,

00:00:07.139 --> 00:00:10.018
and other proprietary assets like trademarks.

00:00:10.733 --> 00:00:11.957
Two backpacks.

00:00:12.007 --> 00:00:14.492
One has more pockets and a better warranty.

00:00:14.542 --> 00:00:18.787
The other is Louis Vuitton, and it sells for many times the price.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.643
That premium is equity at work.

00:00:21.693 --> 00:00:25.970
People know it, rate it, link it with luxury and stay loyal.

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:27.784
Use it like this:

00:00:27.834 --> 00:00:28.634
score the brand on all five,

00:00:28.212 --> 00:00:32.577
then build up the weakest one first.
